      "side": 1,
      "message": "Moreover, I think that\u0027s only a part of the problem. The page could get donated even _before_ we mapped it in the IOMMU page tables, since we map it _after_ unlocking host_ept_lock in verify_page_ownership().\n\nIIUC, pKVM-ARM prevents this race the following way: __pkvm_use_dma() increases the page\u0027s refcount before unlocking the host_mmu.lock, which prevents it from donating after.\n\nSo, the refcount increase should be done as a part of page ownership verification (i.e. with host_ept_lock still locked), not after it? i.e. similarly to pKVM-ARM.",
      "parentUuid": "5ec15a85_a294f0e2",
